HTMX
-------------------------------------------------

Use HTMX wherever possible.

Avoid unnecessary JavaScript.

Use partial template updates.

Use server-rendered HTML fragments.

-------------------------------------------------
ALPINE.JS
-------------------------------------------------

Use Alpine only for:

Dropdowns

Modals

Tabs

Small interactions

-------------------------------------------------
PERFORMANCE
-------------------------------------------------

Minimize JavaScript.

Prefer server-rendered UI.

Use lazy loading.

Use skeleton loaders.

-------------------------------------------------
OUTPUT
-------------------------------------------------

Generate complete code.

Generate all templates.

Generate all routes.

Generate all service files.

Generate API integrations.

Generate responsive layouts.

Generate production-ready code.

No placeholders.

No mock data.

Use the API contract exactly as documented.

